{
    "title": "Quran Majeed - Al Quran",
    "description": "Read Quran offline \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0623\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 is the Islamic app to make flow in your worship time. Real Holy Quran for Muslims to Recite Quran majeed with genuine experience, it observes just like a real Al Quran Book in your hand. Learn & Read the Al Quran \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 with prayer times reminders. Al Quran 30 juz app is a free offline Quran Sharif for a moral day starts, amends of sins, and completion of blessing. Improve your recitation and spiritual experience with the real feel of actual printed Holy Quran \u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 Offline \u200eanytime.\r\n\r\nQuran Sharif  \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 reading app is 16 lines free recitation app where errorless full offline Quran Pak is collected from papers to a smart screen. Recite Holy Quran by surah or by juz. Al Quran 30 Juz app Offline is a nonstop recitation application with similarity to used for all Muslims to read Al Quran Kareem\u200e free.\r\n\r\nHoly Quran with Urdu tarjuma is available with screen touch and free 16-line Holy Quran offline  is easy in terms of turnoff the pages. To go to the next page and read the next 16 lines are simple & easy by swiping the touch screen. Quran Pak \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 is helpful in reading and learning the Quran majeed in your free time.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd34Key features of Read Quran offline  \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0623\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645\u200f are:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd7Endless Quran Majeed recitation\r\n Read Quran offline by Surah or juz\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Offline reading of al Quran \u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645\u200e book\r\n\ud83d\udcd7Complete 16 lines Quran page\r\n\ud83d\udd16Bookmark: Bookmark your favorite surah or juz.\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Kids learning: Noorani Qaida with Audio\r\n\ud83e\udded Compass: To find accurate qibla direction anywhere.\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Search surah by number.\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Colorful themes are available\r\n\ud83c\udf19 Light /dark mode.\r\n\r\nYou can also read the Islam Hadith books from Sahih Al-Bukhari, Sahih Muslim, jam-e-Tirmazi, Sunan abu-Dawood, sunan nasai, Sunan Ibn-e- Maja, Musnad Ahamd, and other free Islamic books and references that you can read and put a mark to save the page, reference, copy and paste and other features to facilitate the Muslims reading\r\n\r\nThe Free Holy Qur\u2019an translated into English, French, Arabic, Deutsch, Italian, Turkey, Melayu, Urdu, Indonesian, \u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be. here and you can listen to and download the entire Al Quran ( \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 ) with the voice of the most famous Imam from Abdul Rehman Al- Sudas, Mishari Rashid Al- Afasy and  Saad Al- ghaamdi. \r\n\r\n\u2728  Some new free features are added to the Holy Quran app \u2728\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0a Quran with Audio Mp3 \r\n \ud83d\udcd6 Verse of the day\r\n\ud83d\udcd7Hadith of the day\r\n\ud83d\udd4c Prayer Locator\r\n\ud83d\udd4cSalah Method\r\n \ud83d\udcd6 6 Kalmas\r\n\u2049\ufe0f Quiz of the day\r\n\ud83d\udd4b 99 Name of ALLAH\r\n\ud83d\udcc5Islamic calendar\r\n\ud83d\ude4f Dua & Azkar\r\n\ud83d\udcff Tasbeeh counter\r\n\r\nHow to use the Holy Quran app \ud83e\udd14?\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49Install the Holy Quran app\r\n\ud83d\udc49After installation, search any surah by number\r\n\ud83d\udc49Start recitation of any surah or juz.\r\n\ud83d\udc49Share or Bookmark your favorite surah.\r\n\ud83d\udc49Click on the done button.\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t leave the readable and time-by-time important Surahs. Add bookmarks to them for instant access. Tilawate Qur\u2019an Kareem is more useful and direct Surah reaching when you make a bookmark there for the direct opening.\r\n\r\nShare and recommend this free offline Quran app -   \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 to your friends and family. . Ameen\ud83d\ude07\ud83d\ude0a",
    "descriptionHTML": "Read Quran offline \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0623\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 is the Islamic app to make flow in your worship time. Real Holy Quran for Muslims to Recite Quran majeed with genuine experience, it observes just like a real Al Quran Book in your hand. Learn &amp; Read the Al Quran \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 with prayer times reminders. Al Quran 30 juz app is a free offline Quran Sharif for a moral day starts, amends of sins, and completion of blessing. Improve your recitation and spiritual experience with the real feel of actual printed Holy Quran \u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 \u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 Offline \u200eanytime.<br><br>Quran Sharif  \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645 reading app is 16 lines free recitation app where errorless full offline Quran Pak is collected from papers to a smart screen. Recite Holy Quran by surah or by juz. Al Quran 30 Juz app Offline is a nonstop recitation application with similarity to used for all Muslims to read Al Quran Kareem\u200e free.<br><br>Holy Quran with Urdu tarjuma is available with screen touch and free 16-line Holy Quran offline  is easy in terms of turnoff the pages. To go to the next page and read the next 16 lines are simple &amp; easy by swiping the touch screen. Quran Pak \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646 is helpful in reading and learning the Quran majeed in your free time.<br><br>\ud83d\udd34Key features of Read Quran offline  \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u0623\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645\u200f are:<br><br>\ud83d\udcd7Endless Quran Majeed recitation<br> Read Quran offline by Surah or juz<br>\ud83d\udcd6 Offline reading of al Quran \u0642\u0631\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645\u200e book<br>\ud83d\udcd7Complete 16 lines Quran page<br>\ud83d\udd16Bookmark: Bookmark your favorite surah or juz.<br>\u270d\ufe0f Kids learning: Noorani Qaida with Audio<br>